00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:02.880
So I've been working with Rajay,
here for a couple of months.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:07.650
And I've been super impressed
at just the level of agility

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:11.370
that his teams have brought
across the entire organization,

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.820
helping their teams to be able
to deploy upwards between 60

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:17.400
to 100 deploys per day.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.960
And that's fantastic.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:23.240
So Rajay, without further ado,
walks through the journey.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.350
RAJAY RAI: Thank you
very much, Allan.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.320
So today I'm going to take
you through a high level

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.200
view of what we do
