00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.220
through who Macquarie Bank is.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:44.610
So Macquarie Bank has a
presence in about 27 countries.

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:48.210
We are a global bank, and one
of the largest infrastructure

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.510
managers, in fact, one of the
largest infrastructure asset

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.040
managers in the world.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:57.927
We have over about 15,000
employees in Macquarie.

00:08:57.927 --> 00:08:59.760
There are five key
divisions than Macquarie.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.600
I work in banking and
financial services,

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.840
which is the retail
